Output .work/out/11-leaving.mp4
Source .work/head.tape
Hide
Source .work/stage.tape
Type "@all we're adding per-key rate limiting to the gateway. maya take the middleware, omar the 429 state in the client, priya a --rate-limit flag, luca the changelog."
Enter
Sleep 10s
Show
Sleep 1500ms

# The legend swaps: "Enter send" becomes "Enter detach", "^O detach" becomes
# "^O cancel". Held so the swap is readable.
Ctrl+O
Sleep 3500ms
Enter
Sleep 4s

# Back at a shell, with the fleet still running behind it.
Type "wake status"
Enter
Sleep 4s
Type "wake"
Enter
Sleep 8s
